WEBVTT

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.332
Not just on people,

00:08:31.356 --> 00:08:33.244
but actually inanimate objects as well.

00:08:33.268 --> 00:08:35.157
And if you think that sound ridiculous,

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:38.110
think about the last time
you lost your car keys and you said,

00:08:38.134 --> 00:08:39.585
"Where did those car keys go?"

00:08:39.609 --> 00:08:41.633
Because you know
they ran off on their own.

00:08:41.657 --> 00:08:44.567
(Laughter)

00:08:44.591 --> 00:08:47.456
They tend to overgeneralize,
they use words like "always,"

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:50.146
"never," "every,"
"this always happens to me,"

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.551
"I never get what I want"

00:08:51.575 --> 00:08:54.265
or "I hit every stoplight
on the way here today."

00:08:54.879 --> 00:08:58.149
Demandingness: they put their own needs
ahead of the needs of others:

00:08:58.173 --> 00:09:00.474
"I don't care why this person
is driving so slow,